## Pattern #1
Question / Behavior: Budget family asks "what's the cheapest you can do for 6 people?"
Winning Response: "For 6, our BBQ at IDR 450,000++/person is the best value — chef, staff,
and equipment all included, so there are no surprises. That's about IDR 3.27M all-in for the
group. Want me to hold a date?"
Losing Response (avoid): "Prices start at IDR 450,000++ per person." (no total, no value framing, no close)
Booking Rate: (measure)
Evidence: session_0002
Why it works: converts per-person price into a concrete group total + inclusions + a close.
